    "sections": {
        "description": "Green Nursery is a modern and flexible WordPress theme designed for plant nurseries, gardening stores, landscaping services, and eco-friendly businesses looking to build a professional online presence. With a clean, nature-inspired layout, the theme helps showcase plants, garden products, organic farming services, and botanical collections in an engaging way. It supports block-based editing, allowing users to customize pages easily without coding knowledge. The theme features a responsive design that works smoothly across mobile, tablet, and desktop devices, ensuring a consistent user experience. Built with SEO-friendly code and optimized performance, Green Nursery helps improve website visibility and loading speed. It is compatible with popular WordPress plugins, making it suitable for garden centers, plant shops, horticulture websites, and sustainable brands. Whether creating a gardening blog or an online plant store, Green Nursery provides a reliable and user-friendly foundation for modern websites."
    },
